{"title":"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_16\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 16</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Fast)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Fast)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(FASTER!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (FASTER!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(FASTEST!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (FASTEST!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(No_Words)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (No Words)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5_(Bash_/_Int._Alg.)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5 (Bash / Int. Alg.)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_16\">Problem 16</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 16\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/5/3459f3d5409f5d9089311b9aab78109a90809414.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{9-6\\sqrt{2}}+\\sqrt{9+6\\sqrt{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"187\" height=\"32\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/4/d547072c02f943167e8154ad8e1d05286670e209.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\,3\\sqrt2 \\qquad\\text{(B)}\\,2\\sqrt6 \\qquad\\text{(C)}\\,\\frac{7\\sqrt2}{2} \\qquad\\text{(D)}\\,3\\sqrt3 \\qquad\\text{(E)}\\,6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"418\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Fast.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Fast)\">Solution 1 (Fast)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Fast)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We find the answer by squaring, then square rooting the expression.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/f/d8f40f0a9e72640d328dd4ea9232983d3959cf37.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} &amp;\\sqrt{9-6\\sqrt{2}}+\\sqrt{9+6\\sqrt{2}}\\\\\\\\ = \\ &amp;\\sqrt{\\left(\\sqrt{9-6\\sqrt{2}}+\\sqrt{9+6\\sqrt{2}}\\right)^2}\\\\\\\\ = \\ &amp;\\sqrt{9-6\\sqrt{2}+2\\sqrt{(9-6\\sqrt{2})(9+6\\sqrt{2})}+9+6\\sqrt{2}}\\\\\\\\ = \\ &amp;\\sqrt{18+2\\sqrt{(9-6\\sqrt{2})(9+6\\sqrt{2})}}\\\\\\\\ = \\ &amp;\\sqrt{18+2\\sqrt{9^2-(6\\sqrt{2})^2}}\\\\\\\\ = \\ &amp;\\sqrt{18+2\\sqrt{81-72}}\\\\\\\\ = \\ &amp;\\sqrt{18+2\\sqrt{9}}\\\\\\\\ = \\ &amp;\\sqrt{18+6}\\\\\\\\= \\ &amp;\\sqrt{24}\\\\\\\\ = \\ &amp;\\boxed{2\\sqrt{6} \\ \\mathbf{(B)}}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"395\" height=\"656\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28FASTER.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(FASTER!)\">Solution 2 (FASTER!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (FASTER!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can change the insides of the square root into a perfect square and then simplify. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/2/e02e5869af070f26c6fc4da61e8250a6eec0067f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{9-6\\sqrt{2}}+\\sqrt{9+6\\sqrt{2}}\\]\" width=\"186\" height=\"32\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/f/6aff7a724692d06cbd7e8f3df5a7be238b574439.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\sqrt{6-6\\sqrt{2}+3}+\\sqrt{6+6\\sqrt{2}+3}\\]\" width=\"268\" height=\"32\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05ef80b4b73b31260ace907c23f8b53d025b03a6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\sqrt{\\left(\\sqrt{6}-\\sqrt{3}\\right)^2}+\\sqrt{\\left(\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{3}\\right)^2}\\]\" width=\"275\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/f/d6f147c33ba05c8fe913961a3c7e8a1b9c12993c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\sqrt{6}-\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{3}\\]\" width=\"182\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/b/04b0280c3b57b9f72db0801133340f04fd95d555.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\boxed{B) 2\\sqrt{6}}\\]\" width=\"85\" height=\"33\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28FASTEST.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(FASTEST!!)\">Solution 3 (FASTEST!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (FASTEST!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Square roots remind us of squares. So lets try to make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/0/b407b1228a0effc8d6ca8121d53dc45c8d4d629e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 - 6\\sqrt{2} = (a-b)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"21\" />. Doing a little experimentation we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/6/886875a4c8cd0a932088de00e10bf5c3e679a98c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[9 - 6\\sqrt{2} = (\\sqrt{6} - \\sqrt{3})^2.\\]\" width=\"184\" height=\"21\" /> Similarly since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/7/c077618d729bf1d57dd85cd6be01e18032c30967.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 + 6\\sqrt{2} = (a+b)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"21\" /> we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/c/46c6d8b6c258732f2c0e078a5defca6da5cba5e9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[9 + 6\\sqrt{2} = (\\sqrt{6} + \\sqrt{3})^2.\\]\" width=\"184\" height=\"21\" /> \n</p><p>We want to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/5/3459f3d5409f5d9089311b9aab78109a90809414.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{9-6\\sqrt{2}}+\\sqrt{9+6\\sqrt{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"187\" height=\"32\" />. Using what we found above we know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/5/f6542b60ed41bc9b34530067d0f99c588b2f9cbd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{9 -6\\sqrt{2}}+\\sqrt{9+6\\sqrt{2}} = (\\sqrt{6} - \\sqrt{3}) + (\\sqrt{6} + \\sqrt{3}) = 2\\sqrt{6}.\\]\" width=\"463\" height=\"32\" /> This is nothing but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/9/179ed16f22553c6e193b82a693631bbc9dc63f9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B) 2\\sqrt{6}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"66\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p><p>~coolmath_2018\n</p><p>Note: This is basically just Solution 2 except you \"do a little experimentation\"\n</p>\n<pre>I'm just saying the fastest would be to say just the answer if you think about it\n</pre>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28No_Words.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(No_Words)\">Solution 4 (No Words)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (No Words)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/b/7bbbbec7940c7617a2b2cd32ed83968c586dea2a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\sqrt{9-6\\sqrt{2}}+\\sqrt{9+6\\sqrt{2}}\\]\" width=\"221\" height=\"32\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/5/dc538dcdabb3322f5350229b9d796143b54a7969.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{2}=9-6\\sqrt{2}+9+6\\sqrt{2}+2\\sqrt{\\left(9-6\\sqrt{2}\\right)\\left(9+6\\sqrt{2}\\right)}\\]\" width=\"417\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/0/320ad091bca1bad8ae6e7956fcd5f7e9f854bc44.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{2}=18+2\\sqrt{81-72}\\]\" width=\"165\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/c/fccd8998aa75d950de8f6603fa25be1fe9b00b93.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{2}=18+2\\sqrt{9}\\]\" width=\"116\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/5/0a5b0da50e55fff284a483364e35ac543a4ea695.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{2}=18+6\\]\" width=\"90\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/e/9ce5dd546f0a08e1ceba32d16e6a80335123a83a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{2}=24\\]\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/9/a598d2cc2bd0a3797589e7ae2704a25a99762799.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\pm\\sqrt{24}\\]\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/f/b5fbe85f713870d1a1e5f9397804a87f1bfe34dd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\pm2\\sqrt{6}\\]\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/3/a63aa0fa2b52437ba658f334387d34af2d564fd4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 2\\sqrt{6}}\\]\" width=\"80\" height=\"33\" />\n</p><p>~JH. L\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_5_.28Bash_.2F_Int._Alg..29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5_(Bash_/_Int._Alg.)\">Solution 5 (Bash / Int. Alg.)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5 (Bash / Int. Alg.)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, factor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/9/c99f089046b752269e77100c333b11d8d72e5895.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"26\" height=\"21\" /> out of the whole expression: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/0/fc032ff65acf7122210d9417b3fdf73dacb43c60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt3\\left(\\sqrt{3-2\\sqrt2}+\\sqrt{3+2\\sqrt2}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"242\" height=\"45\" /> Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/f/5dfa19571b5212af624f51feb9910f57c0aaa886.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{3-2\\sqrt{2}}=a+b\\sqrt2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"177\" height=\"35\" /> We square both sides, leaving us with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/f/b9f0cc30590be47e7403b100aad2e1807de4b58b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-2\\sqrt{2}=a^2+2ab\\sqrt2+2b^2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"232\" height=\"21\" /> We equate coefficients, and we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/d/ccd851c7f082044a619cf0a925de510699f56402.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3=a^2+2b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/5/fb5647468430dd7c760279a73d93394eb0617db1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2=2ab\\implies ab=-1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"195\" height=\"16\" /> We can see a pair of values that works easily, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/f/0cfeeb537a431e3206ce168762d4b8d7b5820667.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)=(1,-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"20\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/8/aa8a1b87539b75edb853feb9e4135a103107bde0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)=(-1,1).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"125\" height=\"20\" /> A quick sign check tells us that the valid solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/2/db24ad52b6a99708f9d50823884bcd2032897bda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-1,1).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"58\" height=\"18\" /> \nSimilarly, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/8/fd8cad3e8b01c09b879d815fff709c42ea078ff0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{3+2\\sqrt{2}},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"89\" height=\"35\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/4/cf4bbb150d902c4b7680ad75bb0ed0e51b61ee4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+\\sqrt2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"62\" height=\"21\" /> \nWhen we add these two, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/d/9dde6dd110cdbfff44c93d2f683d2ed775d134c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"23\" /> and multiplying by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/c/f3cfd0d03d3247e3af33d3d781ab8d2dad5b7f05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt3,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"23\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/e/16e48ba4940e1bf8602523bef7c2d4a4c63e4967.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(B)}~2\\sqrt6}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"82\" height=\"35\" /> \n</p><p>We can quickly check our answer by estimating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/8/d78dfe80d7be3e1bfafb216fab4bf4b2889673be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt2=1.41$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/8/0988f16efce37ad4a1d9dc6faa267ab054788415.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt3=1.73$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"21\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/0/fc032ff65acf7122210d9417b3fdf73dacb43c60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt3\\left(\\sqrt{3-2\\sqrt2}+\\sqrt{3+2\\sqrt2}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"242\" height=\"45\" /> becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/a/92ad71ec6a9348851350ac459f56511d2bdbc1cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt3\\left(\\sqrt{3-2\\cdot1.41}+\\sqrt{3+2\\cdot1.41}\\right)=\\sqrt3\\left(\\sqrt{3-2.82}+\\sqrt{3+2.82}\\right)=\\sqrt3\\left(\\sqrt{0.18}+\\sqrt{5.82}\\right)\\approx\\sqrt3\\left(\\dfrac{3\\sqrt2}{10}+2.4\\right)\\approx1.73\\left(\\dfrac{3\\cdot1.41}{10}+2.4\\right)=1.73\\left(0.423+2.4\\right)=1.73\\left(2.823\\right)\\approx1.7\\cdot2.8\\approx4.76.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"100\" /> This should be our approximate answer. We got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/1/4813f4de97a952cace8430f1b8aae9bd05b141de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt6=2\\sqrt2\\cdot\\sqrt3\\approx2\\cdot1.41\\cdot1.73=2.82\\cdot1.73\\approx2.8\\cdot1.7=4.76$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"497\" height=\"21\" /> - the same thing. \n~Technodoggo\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/c/9ac1354558266508b4407741ff1129cb2ab838a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/2/b72c9e00a667190350c4cddd6b43f7fefffad1dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b= 6\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"67\" height=\"21\" /> and thus\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/d/88d533ee2f1112d69bf1809ce6a80c7ef5b66060.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{a-b} + \\sqrt{a+b} = k\\]\" width=\"164\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/3/d53368e80116dcd932de3e09a9b92e6d794f7820.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a-b + 2\\sqrt{a^2-b^2} + a+b = k^2\\]\" width=\"242\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/5/835b28cbeb850dfd0bf7bedb7d7f49d78ba8f381.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2\\sqrt{a^2-b^2} = k^2-2a\\]\" width=\"161\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/f/68f60551c9dc23a994a6df3f773a8a15d61da999.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4a^2 - 4b^2 = k^4 - 4k^2a + 4a^2\\]\" width=\"219\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/4/cf44200f248a81e30a6802b48f1336e199316530.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4b^2 = 4k^2a - k^4\\]\" width=\"123\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Substitution of our reverse findings, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/8/40827210b2aaa51717501591f5f8505b25dad5f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$288 = 36k^2 - k^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"129\" height=\"18\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/5/335380e5f866c1eabf9799750d076508a23156cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = k^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/0/1e0f1bf5198163930fa1b252e8488e3cc2db172c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = x^2 -36x + 288$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"153\" height=\"18\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/2/b52d47862d417b5cad77858868c9172dca931ccb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-12)(x-24) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"165\" height=\"20\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/a/e5a2b6eb86d5e06086183eb339949b72946c02ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 12,24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"17\" /> in which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/a/85a261ce635d0954e7381d8bd36aecfb0627d434.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 2\\sqrt{3},2\\sqrt{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>From here, one can see the answer choices and get the answer immediately. And, in real competition, you would do that! However, since this is a solution, we will go over it in more detail; why doesn't <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/2/c22088b84f9ac1188544fd85ed748794d264f62f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^2 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"17\" /> work?\n</p><p>Recall that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/d/82de50a39d561887db28690c8cf70a619ee3b594.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt{a^2-b^2} = k^2-2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"163\" height=\"21\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/2/c22088b84f9ac1188544fd85ed748794d264f62f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^2 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/d/1ed651a18e61447b2e6ec8a138fba07d8e62e855.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />, and thus we have a negative number, which is precisely why <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/2/062a51b64b21baa5824cc7d7730feb5c412d3785.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"14\" /> <b>must</b> work.\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is indeed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/a/45a942ff8becae26fb134ca2deaa4aa69ef326e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{2\\sqrt{6}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"46\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ow2axpUP53c\">https://youtu.be/ow2axpUP53c</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A\">2011 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/